---
Title: unknown callout types
---

An unknown type renders as a note, titled with its name capitalised.

> [!foo]
> Pencil icon, note's colour, `data-callout="foo"`.

> [!My-Type] A title of its own
> The name is matched case-insensitively and kept lower-case.

A blockquote that is not a callout stays a blockquote:

> [not a callout]
> Just quoted text.
